<body>

<header>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="kicker">AGENT ENGINEERING · 一页读懂</div>
    <h1>Loop <span class="hl">循环</span> 知识全景</h1>
    <p class="sub">从「你是引擎」到「AI 是引擎」——一条贯穿全文的因果链，把 Verify、成本、5 块积木、搭建顺序全串起来。</p>
    <p class="src">源：Anatoli Kopadze《Loops explained: Claude, GPT, Mira and what actually works》· 精读重构</p>
  </div>
</header>

<nav><div class="wrap">
  <a href="/courses/" style="color: var(--cyan); font-weight: 700; border-color: rgba(90, 209, 200, 0.3); background: rgba(90, 209, 200, 0.05);">← 返回课程类目</a>
  <a href="#s0">Prompt vs Loop</a>
